e en toekomstige personeelsbehoefte. De bedrijfsgegevens die met de Baanopeningenmonitor zijn verzameld, zijn geaggregeerd, opdat het databestand ook kon worden benut voor het beantwoorden van vragen van de regio over hoe de arbeidsmarkt zich zal ontwikkelen."}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Business and Management","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"publication","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"publicationIDType":{"typeName":"publicationIDType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"isbn"},"publicationIDNumber":{"typeName":"publicationIDNumber","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"978-90-5303-126-1"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DTA and POR versions provided by DANS"},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-09-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorType":{"typeName":"contributorType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Sponsor"},"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ministerie van Sociale Zaken en Werkgelegenheid"}}]},{"typeName":"distributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"distributorName":{"typeName":"distributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hanzehogeschool Groningen"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2018-07-12"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2018-07-12"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["•\tSBI-codes komen uit de Standaard Bedrijfs Indeling 2008 (versie 2017) van het Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek\n•\tISCO-codes komen uit de  Codelijsten en beroepenindex 